Further, you know, and someday, Councilor Sang and all the other Councilors, they'll have children that maybe will, you know, go to the school and hopefully it'll still, we want it to thrive and, you know, and always do better than it's doing. You know, we can say, you know, and like you said, there's never enough money for the school. You never know, you know what I'm saying? We can always, there's always needs they can have, but

