01:34:25,407 --> 01:34:41,843
I can promise you this, you have the support of this council for what you need, and we're gonna do the best that we can. Like I said, not only are we elected officials, but we're parents and grandparents of children that are in the school, and we want the best for those kids, too. Thank you.

